[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:The Latest Report]
[00:01.02]Lesson 135 | 第135课
[00:03.48]The latest report | 最新报道
[00:06.20]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:11.61]Is Karen Marsh going to retire, do you think? | 你认为卡伦·马什会退休吗？
[00:17.81]Are you really going to retire, Miss Marsh? | 马什小姐，您真的要退休了吗？
[00:22.65]I may. | 我可能会。
[00:24.46]I can't make up my mind. | 我还没下定决心。
[00:27.69]I will have to ask my future husband. | 我得问问我未来的丈夫。
[00:31.88]He won't let me make another film. | 他不会让我再拍电影了。
[00:36.16]Your future husband, Miss Marsh? | 您未来的丈夫？马什小姐？
[00:39.93]Yes. | 是的。
[00:41.12]Let me introduce him to you. | 让我把他介绍给你们。
[00:43.96]His name is Carlos. | 他叫卡洛斯。
[00:47.20]We're going to get married next week. | 我们下周结婚。
[00:52.36]Look, Liz! | 看，莉兹！
[00:54.42]Here's another report about Karen Marsh. | 这是关于卡伦·马什的另一篇报道。
[00:59.02]Listen: 'Karen Marsh: The latest. | 听着：“卡伦·马什：最新报道。
[01:04.34]At her London Hotel today Miss Marsh told reporters she might retire. | 今天，马什小姐在伦敦的饭店告诉记者，她可能会退休。
[01:13.32]She said she couldn't make up her mind. | 她说她还没下定决心。
[01:17.74]She said she would have to ask her future husband. | 她说她得问问她未来的丈夫。
[01:23.93]She said her future husband would not let her make another film. | 她说她未来的丈夫不会让她再拍电影了。
[01:31.59]Then she introduced us to Carlos and told us they would get married next week.' | 然后她把卡洛斯介绍给我们，并告诉我们他们下周结婚。”
[01:41.48]That's sensational news, isn't it, Kate? | 这真是个爆炸性新闻，不是吗，凯特？
[01:46.98]It certainly is. | 当然是。
[01:49.48]He'll be her sixth husband! | 他将是她的第六任丈夫！